Package: linux-modules-@abiname@@localversion@
Meta-Rules-Target: modules
Meta-Rules-Makeflags: INSTALLDOCS_LINK_DOC=linux-base-@abiname@@localversion@
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel>
Depends:
 linux-base-@abiname@@localversion@ (= ${binary:Version}),
 kmod,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Modules for Linux @abiname@@localversion@
 This contains the kernel modules for Linux @upstreamversion@
 on @longclass@.
 .
 This does not provide a complete kernel installation.  You should
 normally install linux-image-@abiname@@localversion@.
